  "details": "On desktop, the default hand poses are determined by the avatar's animations as set in Unity. After starting VRC and enabling Selfie Expression, the hands are forced into a different pose regardless of what \"Selfie Expression Also Moves Hands\" is set to in the Camera Tracking settings. Unless the \"Selfie Expression Also Moves Hands\" is enabled, hand gestures and poses should remain controlled by the avatar's animations like in normal desktop mode.",
